{"title": "Psychic Missiles", "pageid": 28508, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psychic_Missiles", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Psychic Missiles</b> is a passive feature that enhances magic missile by firing an additional missile.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Shoot an additional dart whenever you cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/38px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/50px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/25px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Spark\" title=\"Psychic Spark\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic_Spark\" title=\"Psychic Spark\">Psychic Spark</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Psychic Missiles applies when the wearer casts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/30px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/40px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Missile\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp/20px-Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d4/Magic_Missile_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Missile\" title=\"Magic Missile\">Magic Missile</a> via any means, not just the once-per-long-rest usage granted by the item.</li>\n<li>During early access, this passive caused Magic Missile to deal an additional 1d4 Psychic damage per missile.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202619\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1299/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10232/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3335/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 873905/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.415      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   35.415      1 -total\n 28.65%   10.146      2 Template:Icon_link\n 27.59%    9.772      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 27.51%    9.744      2 Template:Icon_text\n 25.97%    9.196     10 Template:Trim\n 25.83%    9.149      1 Template:SAI\n 22.23%    7.873      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 20.97%    7.426      4 Template:Ifempty\n 19.83%    7.023      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28508-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202619 and revision id 371041. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}